---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Small Business Internet, Phone and Cell Bill Review | Signal Advisory, Kansas City"
  description="Small businesses pay more than big companies for the same internet and phone service. Send one bill, get a free 24-hour markup of every junk fee and overpriced line. No savings, no fee."
>
  <Nav />

  <section class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 pb-12 pt-24 md:px-10 md:pt-32">
    <p class="mb-4 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-stone">Small business · under 50 employees</p>
    <h1 class="display text-3xl font-light leading-[1.15] md:text-5xl">
      You pay more than the big companies do for the same internet and phone service.
      <em class="text-signal not-italic font-medium">We fix that.</em>
    </h1>
  </section>

  <section class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-8 md:px-10">
    <div class="space-y-10">
      <div class="border-t border-ink/10 pt-8">
        <h2 class="display text-2xl font-medium mb-3">Why your bills are high</h2>
        <p class="text-ink/75 leading-relaxed">
          Carriers charge small businesses full price because nobody pushes back. Almost every bill we review has fees that were never in the contract, lines nobody uses anymore, and a renewal date nobody wrote down. The carrier is counting on you being too busy to notice.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-ink/10 pt-8">
        <h2 class="display text-2xl font-medium mb-3">What we do</h2>
        <p class="text-ink/75 leading-relaxed">
          Send us one bill. Within 24 hours we mark up everything we would challenge. Then you choose: handle it yourself with our markup, or let Brandon negotiate it with the carrier for you. Either way, you keep the providers you have.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-ink/10 pt-8">
        <h2 class="display text-2xl font-medium mb-3">What it costs</h2>
        <p class="text-ink/75 leading-relaxed">
          The review is free. Negotiation is no savings, no fee: if we cannot lower your bill, you owe nothing. If you want us to keep an eye on your bills every month, that starts at $99 a month, is usually covered by the savings we find, and has no long-term contract.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-ink/10 pt-8">
        <h2 class="display text-2xl font-medium mb-3">Who you deal with</h2>
        <p class="text-ink/75 leading-relaxed">
          Brandon, who spent 25 years inside the big carriers before switching to your side of the table. You talk to him directly, in Kansas City. Not a franchise, not a call center.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 flex flex-wrap gap-4 border-t border-ink/10 pt-10">
      <a href="/audit" class="btn-primary">
        Get your free bill review →
      </a>
      <a href="tel:+18163553350" class="btn-ghost-dark">
        Call 816-355-3350
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Base>
